# Cursor Rules for WelineFramework

Read `AI-ENTRY.md`, then follow `dev/ai/global-constraints.md` as the single source of repository-wide AI rules.

Cursor-specific always-on summaries live in `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` and mirror selected rules from `dev/ai/global-constraints.md`; if they conflict, `dev/ai/global-constraints.md` wins.

Always-on Cursor rules include **SSH MCP 远端操作**（`.cursor/rules/ssh-mcp-deploy.mdc`）：SAAS 部署与远端文件操作默认通过 `ssh-mcp` 持久连接 `weline-saas`，禁止 Shell 频繁 `ssh`/`scp`。

Always-on Cursor rules include **回撤禁止默认用 Git**（`.cursor/rules/no-git-rollback-unless-asked.mdc`）：用户要求回撤时须逐处手动还原，除非明确要求用 Git。

Always-on Cursor rules include **交付地址用本地内置 Browser**（`.cursor/rules/local-browser-urls.mdc`）：给用户的可点击 URL 默认用 `http://127.0.0.1:{port}/...` 或 `command:simpleBrowser.api.open?"字面完整URL"`；query 的 `?`/`=`/`&` 禁止二次编码；禁止默认用会跳系统浏览器的 `*.weline.test` Markdown 链接。

Always-on Cursor rules include **真机验收**（`.cursor/rules/real-device-acceptance.mdc`）：**禁止未测报完成**；每次修改都要测；局部函数可用单测，整体功能须 WebUI；详见 `dev/ai/global-constraints.md` §5 / §10.1。

Always-on Cursor rules include **Model 字段变更必须升模块版本**（`.cursor/rules/module-version-on-model-schema.mdc`）：改 `#[Col]`/`#[Table]`/索引等 Schema 声明时，必须同步上调该模块 `etc/module.php` 的 `"version"`，并执行/说明 `setup:upgrade`。详见 `dev/ai/global-constraints.md` §4。

Always-on Cursor rules include **核心框架改动必须提示合并**（`.cursor/rules/core-project-sync.mdc`）：凡改 `app/code/Weline/**`，结案前须向用户给出决策表（文件→建议码→理由）并请确认后再合入对侧；详见 `dev/ai/global-constraints.md` §7。

Always-on Cursor rules include **跨模块禁止硬类引用**（`.cursor/rules/cross-module-event-decoupling.mdc`）：模块之间禁止强制 `use`/注入/`new` 对方具体类；通知与副作用用 Event/Observer 解耦，读取用 Interface 或 `w_query()`。详见 `dev/ai/global-constraints.md` §4。

Always-on Cursor rules include **Framework 核心抽象 + 事件扩展**（`.cursor/rules/framework-core-abstraction-events.mdc`）：`Framework/` 只做平台抽象并提供中立事件；禁止非框架业务语义进入核心；模块接入与模块间协作默认靠 Event。详见 `dev/ai/global-constraints.md` §4。

Additional legacy Cursor protocols remain reference-only unless explicitly triggered by task markers:

- `dev/ai/rules/agent-supervisor-protocol.md` when files contain `@AgentID` or `[SUPERVISOR_TASK]`
- `dev/ai/rules/QUALITY_SYSTEM_CURSOR_RULES.md`
- `dev/ai/rules/multi-agent-protocol.md`
- `dev/ai/rules/efficiency_rules.md`

Quick commands and skill routing are maintained in `AI-ENTRY.md` and `dev/ai/skills/_index.md`.
